principals are "alice", "bob", "unlisted".
resources are "data1", "data2", "unlisted".
actions are "read", "unlisted", "write".
roles are none.
state "available" initially true.
allow when principal is "alice" and resource is "data1" and action is "read" and state "available" is true then set state "available" to false.
allow when principal is "bob" and resource is "data2" and action is "write" and state "available" is true then set state "available" to false.
otherwise deny.
